{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify theme section named ts-912-hero with a headline, a paragraph, an image, and two buttons.
    , Add a schema setting for headline text only, and output updated code.
    
    
    , Add a schema setting for paragraph text only, and wire it to the paragraph in the section. Output updated code.
    , Add a schema image picker setting only, and wire it so the section displays the selected image. Output updated code.
    , Add schema settings for the PRIMARY button: label (text) and link (url). Wire them to the primary button. Output updated code.
    , Add schema settings for the SECONDARY button: label (text) and link (url). Wire them to the secondary button. Output updated code.
    
    , Add a schema product picker setting named product. If no image is selected, use the selected product’s featured image. Output updated code.
    , Add three clickable option buttons inside the section labeled: Straight, Slight Arc, Arc. Do not change the schema. Output updated code.
    
    , Fix the stroke option click behavior:
    
    1) Add data-stroke attributes to the three option buttons:
    - Straight => data-stroke="Straight"
    - Slight Arc => data-stroke="Slight Arc"
    - Arc => data-stroke="Arc"
    
    2) Add a wrapper element around the three buttons with class "ts912-stroke-options".
    
    3) Add JavaScript that runs on DOMContentLoaded:
    - Select all buttons inside .ts912-stroke-options
    - On click: remove class "active" from all buttons, then add class "active" to the clicked button.
    Do not change the schema. Output updated code.
    , Add a text element below the stroke options with class "ts912-recommendation".
    
    Default text:
    "Answer the question to see your fit."
    
    When a stroke option is selected, update the text to:
    "TS-912 recommended for a [selected stroke] stroke."
    
    Do not change existing behavior. Output updated code.
    , Add a simple confidence meter below the recommendation text.
    
    - Display a percentage text starting at "0% confidence"
    - When a stroke is selected, update it to "33% confidence"
    
    Do not change schema. Output updated code.
    , Add a small "Reset" link below the confidence meter.
    
    When clicked:
    - Remove "active" class from all stroke buttons
    - Reset recommendation text to default
    - Reset confidence to "0% confidence"
    
    Output updated code.
    , Add a small text line under the buttons that says:
    "MyGolfSpy tested: 9.4 overall • 3rd best blade putter 2024 • best from 10 feet"
    
    Add a link labeled "Read review" that opens
    https://mygolfspy.com/reviews/blade-putters/t-squared-ts-912-putter/
    in a new tab with rel="noopener".
    
    Output updated code.
    , Add a simple scroll reveal animation using IntersectionObserver.
    
    Apply to the headline, paragraph, stroke options area, and buttons:
    - Start: opacity 0 and translateY(12px)
    - On reveal: opacity 1 and translateY(0) with smooth transition
    
    Respect prefers-reduced-motion:
    - If reduced motion is enabled, show everything immediately with no animation.
    
    Scope all selectors to this section so it works if the section is used multiple times.
    Output updated code.
    , Add a subtle product image tilt/parallax effect on desktop mousemove.
    
    Rules:
    - Only apply if window width >= 990px
    - Max rotation: 6 degrees
    - Smooth return to neutral on mouseleave
    - Disable if prefers-reduced-motion is enabled
    
    Implementation:
    - Wrap the image in a container with class "ts912-tilt"
    - Apply transform to the image or an inner element
    - Scope everything to this section instance (use section.id in selectors)
    
    Do not change existing interaction logic. Output updated code.
    , Add a subtle animated light sweep overlay on the product image.
    
    - Use a pseudo-element or overlay div positioned over the image
    - On hover (desktop), the highlight sweeps across once (translateX)
    - Keep it subtle (low opacity), and disable for prefers-reduced-motion
    
    Do not add external libraries. Output updated code.
    , Add a second question block below the stroke question.
    
    Label: "Typical miss:"
    Add four clickable option buttons inside a wrapper with class "ts912-miss-options":
    Left / Right / Both / Not sure
    
    Do not change existing JS logic yet. Output updated code.
    , Add data-miss attributes to the four miss buttons (Left, Right, Both, Not sure).
    
    Add JavaScript on DOMContentLoaded:
    - Select buttons inside .ts912-miss-options
    - On click: remove class "active" from all, add "active" to clicked
    - Store selected miss value in a variable
    
    Do not change schema. Do not break the existing stroke selection logic. Output updated code.
    , Add a third question block below the miss question.
    
    Label: "Green speed:"
    Add a range slider (input type="range") inside a wrapper with class "ts912-speed".
    Min 1, max 5, default 3.
    
    Show labels under it: "Slow" on the left and "Fast" on the right.
    Add a small live value text with class "ts912-speed-value" that displays:
    "Medium" when value is 3.
    
    Do not change existing JS logic yet. Output updated code.
    , Add JavaScript to listen for input changes on the range slider in .ts912-speed.
    
    When the value changes:
    - 1 or 2 => display "Slow"
    - 3 => display "Medium"
    - 4 or 5 => display "Fast"
    Also store the current speed label in a variable.
    
    Do not change schema. Do not break existing click logic. Output updated code.
    , Update the confidence meter logic:
    
    - If none of the three questions are answered: "0% confidence"
    - If 1 is answered: "33% confidence"
    - If 2 are answered: "66% confidence"
    - If all 3 are answered: "100% confidence"
    
    Count an answer as:
    - Stroke selected (one of the stroke buttons has class active)
    - Miss selected (one of the miss buttons has class active)
    - Speed slider changed from default value 3 OR treat default as unanswered until the user moves it
    
    Output updated code.
    , Update the recommendation text to adapt using the selected answers.
    
    Rules:
    - Always start with "TS-912 recommended."
    - Add one short sentence based on stroke:
      Straight => "Built to keep setup and face control consistent."
      Slight Arc => "Balanced for a natural release with stable feel."
      Arc => "Designed to support your release while staying stable."
      Not sure => "A stable, confidence-building option while you dial in your stroke."
    
    - Add one short sentence based on miss:
      Left => "If you miss left, focus on start-line control and aim."
      Right => "If you miss right, focus on face control through impact."
      Both/Not sure => "Consistency starts with a repeatable setup and alignment."
    
    - Add one short sentence based on green speed:
      Slow => "On slower greens, prioritize solid strike and pace."
      Medium => "A neutral setup for speed control."
      Fast => "On fast greens, stability helps manage tempo and touch."
    
    No absolute claims. Output updated code.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ts-912-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 600px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ts912-tilt {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    perspective: 1000px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ts912-tilt__inner {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease-out;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ts912-tilt__inner::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: -100%;
    width: 50%;
    height: 200%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 50%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%
    );
    transform: skewX(-20deg);
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ts912-tilt:hover .ts912-tilt__inner::after {
      animation: ts912-light-sweep-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1.2s ease-out forwards;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ts912-light-sweep-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      left: -100%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    10% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    90% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      left: 150%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .ts-912-hero__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts-912-hero__paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts-912-hero__question-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts912-stroke-options,
  .ts912-miss-options {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: #000000;
    border: 2px solid #000000;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ts912-speed {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ts912-speed-slider {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    margin: 0 auto 8px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ts912-speed-labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 300px;
    margin: 0 auto 8px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts912-speed-value {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts912-recommendation {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ts912-confidence-meter {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts912-reset-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts912-reset-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ea1e26;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #b30000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: 2px solid #ffffff;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    border-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__review-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__review-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ts-912-hero__review-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }

    .ts912-tilt__inner {
      transition: none !important;
    }

    .ts912-tilt__inner::after {
      display: none;
    }

    @keyframes ts912-light-sweep-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ts-912-hero__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 500px;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 15px;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ts-912-hero__review-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ts-912-hero__review-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ts-912-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ts-912-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ts-912-hero__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ts-912-hero__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% liquid
        assign display_image = block.settings.hero_image
        if display_image == blank and block.settings.product != blank
          assign display_image = block.settings.product.featured_image
        endif
      %}

      {% if display_image %}
        <div class="ts912-tilt">
          <div class="ts912-tilt__inner">
            <img
              src="{{ display_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
              alt="{{ display_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ display_image.width }}"
              height="{{ display_image.height }}"
              class="ts-912-hero__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      {% else %}
        <div class="ts-912-hero__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          <div class="ts-912-hero__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            Add a hero image or select a product
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ts-912-hero__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

    <div class="ts-912-hero__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.headline != blank %}
        <h1 class="ts-912-hero__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.headline }}
        </h1>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.paragraph != blank %}
        <div class="ts-912-hero__paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.paragraph }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ts-912-hero__question-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Stroke type:</div>
        <div class="ts912-stroke-options">
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-stroke="Straight">
            Straight
          </button>
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-stroke="Slight Arc">
            Slight Arc
          </button>
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-stroke="Arc">
            Arc
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ts-912-hero__question-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Typical miss:</div>
        <div class="ts912-miss-options">
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-miss="Left">
            Left
          </button>
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-miss="Right">
            Right
          </button>
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-miss="Both">
            Both
          </button>
          <button class="ts-912-hero__option-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-miss="Not sure">
            Not sure
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ts-912-hero__question-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Green speed:</div>
        <div class="ts912-speed">
          <input
            type="range"
            min="1"
            max="5"
            value="3"
            class="ts912-speed-slider"
          >
          <div class="ts912-speed-labels">
            <span>Slow</span>
            <span>Fast</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ts912-speed-value">Medium</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ts912-recommendation ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        Answer the question to see your fit.
      </div>

      <div class="ts912-confidence-meter ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        0% confidence
      </div>

      <a class="ts912-reset-link ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Reset</a>

      <div class="ts-912-hero__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.button_primary_label != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_primary_link }}"
            class="ts-912-hero__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_primary_label }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_secondary_label != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_secondary_link }}"
            class="ts-912-hero__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_secondary_label }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ts-912-hero__review-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        MyGolfSpy tested: 9.4 overall • 3rd best blade putter 2024 • best from 10 feet
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://mygolfspy.com/reviews/blade-putters/t-squared-ts-912-putter/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="ts-912-hero__review-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      >
        Read review
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</ts-912-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class TsHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.selectedStroke = null;
        this.selectedMiss = null;
        this.selectedSpeed = null;
        this.hasStroke = false;
        this.hasMiss = false;
        this.hasSpeed = false;
        this.speedTouched = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupStrokeOptions();
        this.setupMissOptions();
        this.setupSpeedSlider();
        this.setupScrollReveal();
        this.setupTiltEffect();
      }

      updateRecommendation() {
        const recommendationText = this.querySelector('.ts912-recommendation');
        
        if (!this.hasStroke && !this.hasMiss && !this.hasSpeed) {
          recommendationText.textContent = 'Answer the question to see your fit.';
          return;
        }

        let recommendation = 'TS-912 recommended.';

        if (this.selectedStroke) {
          if (this.selectedStroke === 'Straight') {
            recommendation += ' Built to keep setup and face control consistent.';
          } else if (this.selectedStroke === 'Slight Arc') {
            recommendation += ' Balanced for a natural release with stable feel.';
          } else if (this.selectedStroke === 'Arc') {
            recommendation += ' Designed to support your release while staying stable.';
          }
        }

        if (this.selectedMiss) {
          if (this.selectedMiss === 'Left') {
            recommendation += ' If you miss left, focus on start-line control and aim.';
          } else if (this.selectedMiss === 'Right') {
            recommendation += ' If you miss right, focus on face control through impact.';
          } else if (this.selectedMiss === 'Both' || this.selectedMiss === 'Not sure') {
            recommendation += ' Consistency starts with a repeatable setup and alignment.';
          }
        }

        if (this.selectedSpeed) {
          if (this.selectedSpeed === 'Slow') {
            recommendation += ' On slower greens, prioritize solid strike and pace.';
          } else if (this.selectedSpeed === 'Medium') {
            recommendation += ' A neutral setup for speed control.';
          } else if (this.selectedSpeed === 'Fast') {
            recommendation += ' On fast greens, stability helps manage tempo and touch.';
          }
        }

        recommendationText.textContent = recommendation;
      }

      updateConfidence() {
        const confidenceMeter = this.querySelector('.ts912-confidence-meter');
        let answeredCount = 0;
        
        if (this.hasStroke) answeredCount++;
        if (this.hasMiss) answeredCount++;
        if (this.hasSpeed) answeredCount++;
        
        const confidencePercent = answeredCount * 33;
        const displayPercent = answeredCount === 3 ? 100 : confidencePercent;
        
        confidenceMeter.textContent = `${displayPercent}% confidence`;
      }

      setupStrokeOptions() {
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
          const strokeButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ts912-stroke-options button');
          const resetLink = this.querySelector('.ts912-reset-link');
          
          strokeButtons.forEach(button => {
            button.addEventListener('click', () => {
              strokeButtons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
              button.classList.add('active');
              
              this.hasStroke = true;
              this.selectedStroke = button.getAttribute('data-stroke');
              this.updateRecommendation();
              this.updateConfidence();
            });
          });

          resetLink.addEventListener('click', () => {
            strokeButtons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
            const missButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ts912-miss-options button');
            missButtons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
            
            const speedSlider = this.querySelector('.ts912-speed-slider');
            const speedValue = this.querySelector('.ts912-speed-value');
            if (speedSlider) {
              speedSlider.value = 3;
              speedValue.textContent = 'Medium';
              this.speedTouched = false;
            }
            
            this.hasStroke = false;
            this.hasMiss = false;
            this.hasSpeed = false;
            this.selectedStroke = null;
            this.selectedMiss = null;
            this.selectedSpeed = null;
            this.updateRecommendation();
            this.updateConfidence();
          });
        });
      }

      setupMissOptions() {
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
          const missButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ts912-miss-options button');
          
          missButtons.forEach(button => {
            button.addEventListener('click', () => {
              missButtons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
              button.classList.add('active');
              
              this.hasMiss = true;
              this.selectedMiss = button.getAttribute('data-miss');
              this.updateRecommendation();
              this.updateConfidence();
            });
          });
        });
      }

      setupSpeedSlider() {
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
          const speedSlider = this.querySelector('.ts912-speed-slider');
          const speedValue = this.querySelector('.ts912-speed-value');
          
          if (!speedSlider || !speedValue) return;
          
          speedSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
            const value = parseInt(e.target.value);
            let label = 'Medium';
            
            if (value === 1 || value === 2) {
              label = 'Slow';
            } else if (value === 3) {
              label = 'Medium';
            } else if (value === 4 || value === 5) {
              label = 'Fast';
            }
            
            speedValue.textContent = label;
            
            if (!this.speedTouched) {
              this.speedTouched = true;
            }
            
            this.hasSpeed = this.speedTouched;
            this.selectedSpeed = label;
            this.updateRecommendation();
            this.updateConfidence();
          });
        });
      }

      setupScrollReveal() {
        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
        
        if (prefersReducedMotion) {
          const revealElements = this.querySelectorAll('.ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          revealElements.forEach(el => el.classList.add('is-visible'));
          return;
        }

        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            }
          });
        }, {
          threshold: 0.1,
          rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'
        });

        const revealElements = this.querySelectorAll('.ts-912-hero__reveal-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        revealElements.forEach((el, index) => {
          el.style.transitionDelay = `${index * 0.1}s`;
          observer.observe(el);
        });
      }

      setupTiltEffect() {
        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
        if (prefersReducedMotion) return;

        const tiltContainer = this.querySelector('.ts912-tilt');
        const tiltInner = this.querySelector('.ts912-tilt__inner');
        
        if (!tiltContainer || !tiltInner) return;

        const maxRotation = 6;

        const handleMouseMove = (e) => {
          if (window.innerWidth < 990) return;

          const rect = tiltContainer.getBoundingClientRect();
          const x = e.clientX - rect.left;
          const y = e.clientY - rect.top;
          
          const centerX = rect.width / 2;
          const centerY = rect.height / 2;
          
          const rotateX = ((y - centerY) / centerY) * maxRotation;
          const rotateY = ((centerX - x) / centerX) * maxRotation;
          
          tiltInner.style.transform = `rotateX(${rotateX}deg) rotateY(${rotateY}deg)`;
        };

        const handleMouseLeave = () => {
          tiltInner.style.transform = 'rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg)';
        };

        tiltContainer.addEventListener('mousemove', handleMouseMove);
        tiltContainer.addEventListener('mouseleave', handleMouseLeave);
      }
    }

    customElements.define('ts-912-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', TsHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

